jobs.description:
Are you accurate and do you enjoy working with different materials and machines? For our client in Waalwijk, we are looking for a Production Employee for the Preparation Department. Together with a team of four colleagues, you will transform bulk materials into precisely sized components used in the production of custom-made sandwich panels.

What will you do?

You will work with materials such as foam, wood, and composite. Using production lists, you will cut and calibrate these materials to the required dimensions.

- Adjust materials to the correct thickness using various saws and calibration machines;
- Cut materials to size at your own workstation;
- Calibrate material thickness using a thickness planer;
- Label components according to the production list and sort them onto transport carts;
- Keep your work area clean and organized.

Since every sandwich panel is custom-made, you will work with different production lists and dimensions every day.

What do we expect from you?

- You work accurately and enjoy working as part of a team;
- You can read production lists or are willing to learn;
- You speak Dutch or English.

SamenvattingDo you prefer working at night, staying active, and would you like to be part of one of the world's largest logistics companies? Then be sure to read on! Good Work!Over de functieAs a Warehouse Employee, you ensure that parcels are sorted and scanned. You are therefore an important link in the logistics process! This is an active job that involves a lot of walking and lifting.
- Loading and unloading parcels from trucks;
- Sorting parcels by destination and size;
- Scanning parcels and updating tracking systems;
- Reporting damaged or suspicious parcels.

This job is for 20–25 hours per week. The shifts are night shifts on weekdays.
Working hours:
You start between 2:00 AM and 3:00 AM and finish between 6:00 AM and 10:00 AM, usually around 8:00 AM.
Over het bedrijfYour new employer, DHL, is an indispensable link in the global logistics process. Parcels are sorted, shipped, and delivered in more than 200 countries.
Wat wij vragen- Own accomodation in The Netherlands;
- You speak basic Dutch or English;
- You are in good physical condition and able to lift heavy items;
- You are available to work night shifts.

Of course, these points are essential for the role of order picker, but we are primarily interested in who you are! Inspire us.
Wat wij bieden- A salary of €14,99 gross per hour;
- 130% allowance on top of your salary for working in the night;
- 150% allowance if you work overtime;
- 200% pay for working on public holidays;
- 8% holiday allowance;
- Opportunities for career growth and professional development.

Meer informatieAre you interested in the job of Warehouse Employee? You can apply within 2 minutes. Do you have some questions first? Kamila answers them via +31625477379 and k.spiewak@carriere.com. Good work!

SamenvattingStart as an Orderpicker in Woerden and help keep Jumbo stores stocked across the Netherlands. Earn up to €23.39 gross per hour, and enjoy a hands-on logistics job with clear routines and a supportive team. No specific education required, just motivation and a willingness to learn. Good work!Over de functieAs an Orderpicker, you’ll prepare orders for Jumbo stores across the Netherlands using a modern voice-pick system. Depending on the assignment, you will work in a warm (+18°C) or chilled (+2°C to +4°C) area at the warehouse.

Your tasks:
-  Picking orders with a voice-pick system;
-  Placing products on trolleys or pallets;
-  Checking orders for accuracy and quality;
-  Keeping your workspace clean and organized;
-  Following warehouse and safety procedures;

This job is for 32–40 hours per week in a two-shift system, with occasional weekend work.
The worktimes are from 06.00 - 14:00 and 14.00 - 21:00.
Over het bedrijfAt Jumbo’s distribution centre in Woerden, teamwork keeps things moving. Every day, colleagues work together to prepare orders and make sure stores across the Netherlands receive the groceries and everyday products their customers need. You will join a modern, well-organized workplace where everyone plays a part. Clear procedures, a focus on quality and helpful colleagues make it a great place to gain experience in logistics and develop your skills.
Wat wij vragen- Own accommodation in The Netherlands. For this job we don't provide housing;
- Basic English skills to understand instructions and communicate with your team
- Willingness to work in warm and chilled areas;
- Physically stable and comfortable with walking and lifting during the shift;
- You are available to work in 2-shifts.

Of course, these points are essential for the role of order picker, but we are primarily interested in who you are! Inspire us.
Wat wij bieden- A salary between €14.99 and €15.21 gross per hour for work in the warm warehouse and €15.37–€15.59
